#: r2/lib/strings.py:138
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **monthly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each month until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional months of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Do stiest op it punt om in trochrinnend, automatysk ferlingd abonnemint op tippr gold foar dysels (%(user)s) op te setten. \n"
"\n"
"Do betellest dêr **%(price)s** foar, **moanliks**. \n"
"\n"
">Dit abonnemint wurdt elke moanne automatysk ferlinge oant do it opseist. Do kinst op elk momint opsizze. As do opseist, wurde der gjin ekstra moannen yn rekken brocht, en de tsjinst rint troch oant it ein fan de rekkenperioade. As do opseist, krigest gjin jild werom foar tsjinst dy't al betelle is. Kwitânsjes wurde as privee berjocht yn dyn akkount levere."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **yearly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each year until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional years of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Do stiest op it punt om in trochrinnend, automatysk ferlingd abonnemint op tippr gold foar dysels (%(user)s) op te setten. \n"
"\n"
"Do betellest dêr **%(price)s** foar, **jierliks**. \n"
"\n"
">Dit abonnemint wurdt elk jier automatysk ferlinge oant do it opseist. Do kinst op elk momint opsizze. As do opseist, wurde der gjin ekstra jierren yn rekken brocht, en de tsjinst rint troch oant it ein fan de rekkenperioade. As do opseist, krigest gjin jild werom foar tsjinst dy't al betelle is. Kwitânsjes wurde as privee berjocht yn dyn akkount levere."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:140
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to make a one-time purchase of %(amount)s of tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "Do stiest op it punt foar ien kear in oankeap fan %(amount)s oan tippr gold te dwaan foar dysels (%(user)s). Hjirfoar betellesto in totaalbedrach fan %(price)s."

