#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have been added as a moderator to [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Lokwinske!** Do bist tafoege as moderator fan [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Wolkom by de Tippr-moderatormienskip!\n"
"\n"
"As moderator spilest in wichtige rol by it opbouwen en ûnderhâlden fan ús mienskip. Hjir binne in pear wichtige dingen om te witten:\n"
"\n"
"### Dyn ferantwurdlikheden\n"
"\n"
"- Hanthavenje de regels fan de vault en it belied foar de hiele side\n"
"- Soargje foar in gastfrije sfear foar de leden fan de mienskip\n"
"- Besjoch rapporten en nim passende maatregels\n"
"- Wurkje gear mei oare moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Wichtige boarnen\n"
"\n"
"- [Rjochtlinen foar moderators](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Lear oer goede gewoanten en ferwachtingen\n"
"- [Ynhâldsbelied](/help/contentpolicy) - Begryp de regels foar de hiele side\n"
"- [Brûkersoerienkomst](/help/useragreement) - Ken de tsjinstbetingsten\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Kom yn kontakt mei oare moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Frijwilligersstatus\n"
"\n"
"Tink derom dat moderators ûnôfhinklike frijwilligers binne, gjin meiwurkers fan Tippr. Lês foar mear details de [Rjochtlinen foar moderators](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Tank datsto helpst om fan Tippr in moai plak te meitsjen!"

